  "mud-sport": "For 5 turns, all Electric-type attacks used by any active Pokemon have their power multiplied by 0.33. Fails if this effect is already active.",
  "ice-ball": "If this move is successful, the user is locked into this move and cannot make another move until it misses, 5 turns have passed, or the attack cannot be used. Power doubles with each successful hit of this move and doubles again if Defense Curl was used previously by the user. If this move is called by Sleep Talk, the move is used for one turn.",
  "needle-arm": "Has a 30% chance to make the target flinch.",
  "slack-off": "The user restores 1/2 of its maximum HP, rounded half up.",
  "hyper-voice": "No additional effect.",
